<h6 style="text-align:center;" data-zesty-id="content:text:1:37">Senior Programs</h6>
<p style="text-align:center;" data-zesty-id="content:textarea:2:3">
	More than 14% of Americans over age 71 are affected by dementia. Research suggests that elderly care involving human contact and interpersonal conversation lowers the impact of dementia and depression. The Salvation Army works to provide&nbsp;programs and services to assist seniors socially, emotionally, and financially.&nbsp;
</p>
<p style="text-align:center;" data-zesty-id="content:textarea:3:55"><strong>Community Center</strong></p>
<p style="text-align:center;" data-zesty-id="content:textarea:4:78">902 Wake Forest Road</p>
<p style="text-align:center;" data-zesty-id="content:textarea:5:84">Raleigh, NC 27604</p>
